{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05386","headline":"奉和御制左丞相说右丞相璟太子少傅乾曜同日上官命都堂赐诗 · 裴光庭","name":"奉和御制左丞相说右丞相璟太子少傅乾曜同日上官命都堂赐诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乐贤闻往诰，褒德偶兹辰。\n端揆升元老，师谋择累仁。\n紫庭崇让毕，粉署礼容陈。\n既荷恩荣旧，俱承宠命新。\n天文悬瑞色，圣酒泛华茵。\n杂遝喧箫鼓，欢娱洽搢绅。\n掖垣招近侍，虚薄[厕]清尘。\n共保坚贞节，常期雨露均。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05386.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05386","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}